<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="1">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">FADE IN:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="1" Title=""/>
      <Text>EXT. Arid Mountainous Desert - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>RICK BROOKS, 28, races on foot along the dry, cracked ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Suddenly an explosion rocks him to the left, but he rolls with it and pushes himself on, faster, harder than before.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Multiple smaller explosions perforate the ground behind him. Someone or something clearly wants Rick dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I don’t carry weapons.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Rick runs fast, quickly approaching a cliff with a devastating, vertigo-inducing drop. Shots ring past his face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (V.O.) (Cont’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Don’t need ‘em.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Rick brazenly jumps off the cliff with a beautifully-executed swan dive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (V.O.) (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I can’t fly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He presses his arms tightly to his sides, achieving perfect aerodynamic posture, as the something that was chasing him makes it’s way to the edge of the cliff.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A gruesome nine-foot-tall BEAST carrying a weapon not-of-this-earth skids to a halt. It becomes clear we’re not in the Mojave. Nowhere near.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (v.O.) (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m not invincible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Rick rockets head first towards the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (v.O.) (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But, I’m not defenseless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He sees another BEAST patrolling the base of the cliff that he’s hurtling towards.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>It’s of supreme luck that this beast below doesn’t see him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (v.O.) (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I have one very specific ability that makes me the most sought-after sucker in the universe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>In a flash of light, Rick disappears, leaving a swill of particles that rush to occupy the empty space he left in his wake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (v.O.) (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I can control. I can... become.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The beast at the bottom of the cliff gets knocked uncomfortably off its stance by an invisible force.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (v.O.) (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Think of it like hot-wiring a car.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The beast regains its balance. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Rick, now in complete control of the beast, looks down at his hands holding his own very menacing firearm. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>He looks up to the top of the cliff and performs a very arrogant salute at the other nine-foot-tall beast who now stands there, confused.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Rick, as the beast, then turns and casually saunters off in the other direction. Throwing his gun over his shoulder triumphantly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A smile creeps across the beast’s face as he walks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>RICK (v.O.) (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(smugly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Sure beats waiting tables.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>SMASH TO TITLE CARD.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>FADE OUT.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

